@startuml
!theme azure
left to right direction

component "API Gateway" as gateway
component "Azure Functions" as func
database "Cosmos DB (Hot)" as cosmos
cloud "Blob Storage (Cold)" as blob
component "CDN" as cdn
component "Cognitive Search" as search
component "Application Insights" as ai

gateway --> func : Read/Write
func --> cosmos : Recent data
func --> blob : Archive data
blob --> cdn : Caching
blob --> search : Indexing
func --> ai : Monitoring
cosmos --> func : Change Feed

